move is objectively best.\n\n**Reason**: d5xe4 captures an undefended white knight on e4, giving Black a material advantage (+3 points). It also clears central pawn tension and improves Black’s central control. Other moves don’t win material or create such immediate gain.\n\n**Answer**: P: d5-e4"}
